Description: Wild OS Write and Tables, the parts both share
 Documents and spreadsheets for Wild OS. Write and Tables are LibreOffice
 Writer and Calc with Wild OS start screens, ribbons and defaults: Word and
 Excel files open with them and save back as .docx and .xlsx unless asked
 otherwise. This package holds what they share; wildos-write and
 wildos-tables are the apps, so each can be removed on its own.

Package: wildos-write
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 wildos-office (>= 0.1.4),
 libreoffice-writer,
Breaks: wildos-office (<< 0.1.4~)
Replaces: wildos-office (<< 0.1.4~)
Description: Wild OS Write
 Documents for Wild OS: LibreOffice Writer with the Wild OS start screen,
 ribbon and defaults. Word files open with it and save back as .docx.

Package: wildos-tables
